Gecko codes online wait for the other build's message (patches/net-0015, on net-0014; the Mac port's mac-0003): the session started
at the first poll that read as connected, before the other side's build message (sent with the connection) had arrived, so with
40 ms of lag, or a peer that finished connecting later, a side that had turned codes on started without consent and never offered
them. It now waits for every other player's build message, at most 3 s (Slippi Dolphin and melee-unlocked send none: no consent,
as before). The rules and messages are unchanged: the wire format is net-0014's. MELEE_NET_TEST_SLOW_CONNECT_MS=N (tests only)
finishes this side's connection N ms late, which lands the other side in that window every time. Applied by ../net_sources.sh
after net-0014.
